  "All protocols and specifications on this site are versioned research drafts (currently v0.1). They are not official standards, have not been adopted by any standards body, and may change without notice.": "Protocol zonna n'ebipimo byonna ku mukutu guno nteekateeka za kunoonyereza ez'emyaka (kaakano v0.1). Si mateeka ga lukale, tegannakkirizibwa kibiina kyonna eky'ebipimo, era biyinza okukyuka awatali kulabula.",
  "All specs": "Ebipimo Byonna",
  "Allowed": "Kikkirizibwa",
  "An experiment in AI/agent governance: this site is itself a working example": "Okugezesa mu bufuzi bwa AI/AI ez'obwannannyini: omukutu guno gwennyini kyokulabirako ekikola",
  "Answer \"may AI learn from this?\" with dimension-level precision instead of a crawl bit.": "Ddamu ekibuuzo \"AI eyinza okuyiga ku kino?\" mu buneneezi obw'oku mitendera egy'enjawulo, so si kabonero kamu aka funza.",
  "Anthropic’s interpretability team identified internal \"emotion vectors\" in Claude Sonnet 4.5 that activate in contextually appropriate situations and causally shape behavior — for instance, amplifying a \"desperate\" vector increased blackmail-like responses, while boosting \"calm\" reduced them. The team stresses this shows functional, behavior-shaping emotion states, not evidence of subjective feeling.": "Ekibiina kya Anthropic eky'okutegeera by'omunda mu AI kyazuula \"obulambulukufu bw'okuwulira\" (emotion vectors) mu Claude Sonnet 4.5, ebiyimuka mu mbeera ezisaanidde era ebikwata ku mpisa ez'omudeeli. Okugeza, okwongera ku \"obwesuubaze\" kwayongera ku biddamu ebifaanana obutiisatiisa, ate okwongera ku \"obuteefu\" kwakendeeza ku byo. Ekibiina kinnyonnyola nti kino kiraga mbeera z'okuwulira ezikola ku mpisa, so si bujulizi bw'okuwulira okw'obuntu obw'ekyokka.",
  "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents": "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents",
  "Argues that ontology — once dismissed as impractical — has become load-bearing infrastructure for AI reliability: large language model hallucination exposed a missing layer of \"meaning,\" and pragmatic, embedded ontologies now function as guardrails that anchor probabilistic output to accountable action.": "Kirowooza nti ontology — eyali eyagaanibwa nga tegasa mu mirimu — kaakano efuuse omusingi omukulu ogw'okwesiga AI: obulimba bw'emitindo emikulu egy'olulimi (hallucination) bwalaga omuzingo ogwabulako ogw'\"amakulu,\" era ontologies ez'omugaso ezisibiddwa mu sisitemu kaakano zikola ng'ebikuuma ebisiba ebifulumizibwa eby'obusobozi ku bikolwa ebiriko obuvunaanyizibwa.",
  "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence": "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence",
  "Artificial Persons": "Abantu Abakoleddwa",
  "At the UN’s inaugural Global Dialogue on AI Governance in Geneva, Secretary-General António Guterres called for coordinated worldwide rules covering everything from child-safety obligations on AI developers to limits on unsafe autonomous weapons, warning that unchecked AI could deepen inequality between rich and poor nations.": "Ku lukungaana lwa UN olusooka olw'Emboozi y'Ensi Yonna ku Bufuzi bwa AI mu Geneva, Katikkiro Omukulu António Guterres yasaba amateeka agakwataganyizibwa ag'ensi yonna, okuva ku buvunaanyizibwa bw'obukuumi bw'abaana eri abakola AI okutuuka ku kukoma kw'ebyokulwanyisa ebyeetambulira ebitali bikuumi, ng'alabula nti AI etatunuulirwa eyinza okwongera obutali bwenkanya wakati w'amawanga agagagga n'agaavu.",
