  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Ebyokulabirako bya koodi, JSON Schemas, n'ebikozesebwa bya polisi ebisomeka makina birina layisensi ya MIT wabula bwe kiba kirina okulagibwa mu ngeri endala. Osobola okubissaawo ku mikutu gyo bwereere.",
