  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Fuula endagiriro z'eddembe akatale k'obuyisensi akakola, mu kifo ky'okuba yintaneeti eya ye/nedda okuggulwa/okuggalwa.",
