  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Enteekateeka entuufu: nteekateeka z'okunoonyereza ezetongodde, enteekateeka za protocol, n'okugezesa okuggule mu bipimo.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Kikyusiddwa okuva ku ekyasooka: Belgium (BE) kaakano kiraga Kidaaki mu kifo ky'Olufalansa — abogezi ba Flemish be bangi mu ggwanga (~60%) okusinga abogezi ba Walloon Olufalansa (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Kikyusiddwa okuva ku ekyasooka: Kazakhstan (KZ) kaakano kiraga Kikazaki mu kifo ky'Olusaasi, kaakano nga envunuula ya Kikazaki eriwo — nga kye kimu n'okulongoosa kwa Belgium okwasooka.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
