  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Kifuula eddembe erirangiddwa okuba obuyisensi obuyinza okukolebwa: okusaba omuwendo, okusasula, okukakasa, okwekenneenya, okuggyawo.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Ennimi amakumi abiri ziriwo zonna: Oluzungu, Lucayina olw'Edda, Lucayina Olutuufu, Lujapaani, Lukoreya, Lufalansa, Lujjaaman, Lusipania, Lupolutugiizi, Lusaasi, Luwalabu, Lutaakii, Lupasiya, Lubbengali, Luhindi, Luyindonezya, Luvyetinaamu, Luyonaani, Luyitale, ne Kidaaki.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Emitendera ebiri egya layisensi: omutendera ogwa bwereere ogw'abantu bonna n'omutendera ogw'obusuubuzi ogusinziira ku kutukwatagana.",
  "UI": "Omukutu (UI)",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Obuggule obutannategeezebwa buragibwa emikutu gya AI nga tebulina bukakafu mu mateeka era bukuŋŋaanibwa ebweru; olukusa lwa protocol olusomeka makina lwokka lwe lufuula ebirimu okuba ebiyiga mu butuufu.",
  "Usage logs and audit trails": "Endagiriro z'Okukozesa n'Endagiriro z'Okwekenneenya",
