  "Verified dataset markets and collective licensing": "Obutale bw'Ebibaawo Ebikakasibwa n'Obuyisensi obw'Awamu",
  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Kikakasiddwa mu mbeera zombi eza LTR ne RTL: ekipande kifaananako bulungi eri Kiwalabu ne Kipasiya awatali nkola za njawulo, nga kikozesa logical CSS positioning.",
  "Verify": "Kakasa",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts.": "Ebyafaayo by'Emyaka egy'Omukutu Guno n'Enteekateeka zaagwo eza Protocol.",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts. Breaking spec changes are recorded here.": "Ebyafaayo by'Emyaka egy'Omukutu Guno n'Enteekateeka zaagwo eza Protocol. Enkyukakyuka ez'ebipimo ezimenya kompyubu ziwandiikibwa wano.",
  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Ebipimo eby'emyaka, JSON Schemas, n'empapula za polisi ezimaze okussibwawo ku mukutu guno mu butuufu. Buli kiwandiiko kisobola okuggyibwa, okukakasibwa, era okuwaŋŋulwa butereevu.",
  "Versioning": "Okuwa Emyaka",
  "Versions": "Emyaka",
  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Obutambi n'amaddoboozi ebiwerera protocol n'empapula — omuzingo gw'eddembe lya AI, oguyinza okulabibwa n'okuwulirizibwa.",
  "Videos": "Obutambi",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Oyagala okukola ekiwandiiko kyo ekya polisi?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Enkula z'ennukuta zisitulwa okuva ku Google Fonts, eyinza okufuna okusaba okutongole okw'enkula z'ennukuta okuva mu browser yo. Tewali script endala ya wabweru ekozesebwa.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Sisitemu za AI ky'eziyinza okukola ku birimu: okusoma, okufunza, okukyusa, okuggyayo, okuyigiriza, okufuula bya bwenkulungo, okuzza mu maaso. Amateeka ga AICR n'omuzingo gwa AICL ogw'obuyisensi bifuula eddembe lino okuba erirangika n'eriyinza okukolebwako emirimu.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Ekyo poliyita (server) ky'eyinza okuddamu crawler ya AI bw'esaba ebirimu ebiriko layisensi awatali token ya layisensi — omuwendo ogusobola okukolebwako makina mu kifo ky'ekkubo eriggwaawo.",
  "What this site is": "Omukutu Guno Kye Guli",
  "What this site is not": "Ekyo Omukutu Guno Kye Gutali",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Obanga AI eyinza okuyiga, mu buziba ki, ku bigendererwa ki, n'obuvunaanyizibwa ki. Okusomebwa si kwe kuyigibwako; \"tekigaanyibwa\" si kye \"kiyigika\". AIRS ne AILP bifuula olukusa lw'okuyiga okuba olutindo oluyongeddeyongedde olusomeka makina.",
  "Whitepapers": "Empapula Njeru",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Empapula Njeru & Ebiwandiiko",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Empapula njeru zisigala nga za Luzungu olubereberye mu ngeri gye zaazimbibwa; empapula ezisomeka makina zisigala nga tezirina lulimi lumu.",
  "Who is behind it": "Ani Ali Emabega w'Ekintu Kino",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Lwaki akabonero kamu aka kukkiriza/okugaana katasobola kufuga okukozesa ebirimu mu kiseera kya AI — n'omuzingo gw'eddembe bwe gulabika mu kifo ky'akabonero ako.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Lwaki Obuggule Obutannategeezebwa Bukuŋŋaanibwa Ebweru mu Mikutu gy'Okuyigiriza",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak, ne Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) bawaayo endowooza nti empaka za filosofiya ku bumanyirivu bwa AI zeerabira okunoonyereza kw'ebirowoozo ku mpisa ez'ensolo — obusosola bw'ebirowoozo n'obw'abantu obwo bwennyini obukoma ku kulowoozebwako mu bwesimbu eri ensolo, era bujja kukoma ku AI, ka kibeere nga AI ejja okuba n'obumanyirivu oba nedda.",
  "You are leaving AGIRight.org": "Ova ku AGIRight.org",
